# English-only code

The user may give instructions in Spanish. Always implement in **English**.

## Must be English
- File and folder names
- React components, hooks, functions, variables, types
- CSS class names and custom properties added going forward
- Comments and commit messages
- i18n **keys** (e.g. `play`, `settings`)

## May stay Spanish
- Player-facing strings in the `es` i18n object
- Story/quiz narrative text inside content JSON
- Legal terms document text
- Legacy localStorage migration keys (read-only compatibility)
- Unity export field names that match the exported schema until re-exported

Do not introduce new Spanish identifiers in TypeScript, TSX, CSS, or tooling scripts.
